เวรดึก อาคาร ๓ (Night Round, Building 3): found-footage camcorder tape, 60 s

Engine: adapted from the "Liminal Found Footage" (backrooms) demo of lemo-opuscar by Lemomo (LemoLab),
https://github.com/lemomo-ai/lemo-opuscar, MIT licence (code). The story, rules, school, figure, captions and
sound design here are new.

All visuals, textures, the silhouette, the VHS look, the OSD font and all sound effects are made by code.

Fonts (SIL Open Font License 1.1, via google/fonts): IBM Plex Sans Thai, IBM Plex Sans, IBM Plex Sans Condensed, IBM Plex Mono
Voices: Meta MMS-TTS Thai (facebook/mms-tts-tha, CC BY-NC 4.0), processed in mix.py
